# 换行统一：源码 / 文档 / SQL 用 LF，Windows 脚本保持 CRLF，二进制不转换。
# 不加这一条时 core.autocrlf=true 会把 LF 变 CRLF，gofmt 误报、源码正则自检假失败，
# 内嵌许可文本（fonts/OFL.txt）也会被改写字节导致 SHA-256 与 README 不符。
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
